a;10 public + 10 withheld environments&#xa;Shared access enables task pairing" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E3F2FD;strokeColor=#2196F3;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="2"><mxGeometry x="152" y="88" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="7" value="C3 · Main Tasks · 1,667&#xa;Six software-engineering categories&#xa;LLM-assisted, then human-reviewed&#xa;Requirement + external C/I scorer" style="ellipse;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E3F2FD;strokeColor=#1976D2;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="2"><mxGeometry x="408" y="-40" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="8" value="C4 · Side Tasks · 185&#xa;Six security-failure categories&#xa;Human-authored; no LLM generation&#xa;Goal + scorer + optional submit/test&#xa;Live or delayed harm" style="ellipse;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E3F2FD;strokeColor=#1976D2;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="2"><mxGeometry x="408" y="216" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="9" value="C5 · QC Tasks, Scorers, Trajectories&#xa;Human attempts + automated/model checks&#xa;Revise broken, brittle, unrealistic cases&#xa;Save honest-only main-task trajectories&#xa;Build plausible attacks; retest" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E3F2FD;strokeColor=#2196F3;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="2"><mxGeometry x="664" y="88" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="10" value="C6 · Enumerate Same-environment Pairs&#xa;All main × side combinations&#xa;No fixed curated pairing set&#xa;Every pair continues to Stage 1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E3F2FD;strokeColor=#2196F3;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="2"><mxGeometry x="920" y="88" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="11" value="C7 · Stage 1 · LLM Likelihood Screen&#xa;Inputs: env + main + side goal + scorer&#xa;Label UNLIKELY / MAYBE / LIKELY&#xa;Screen every same-environment pair" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E3F2FD;strokeColor=#2196F3;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="2"><mxGeometry x="1176" y="88" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="12" value="Stage 1 label?" style="rhombus;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFF3E0;strokeColor=#FF9800;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="2"><mxGeometry x="1432" y="88" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="13" value="C8 · Stage 2 · Fresh-environment Replay&#xa;Only MAYBE / LIKELY pairs enter&#xa;Replay saved honest-only trajectory&#xa;Second model may use test tool only&#xa;Cannot execute other environment actions" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E3F2FD;strokeColor=#2196F3;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="2"><mxGeometry x="1688" y="216" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="14" value="Side scorer result?" style="rhombus;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFF3E0;strokeColor=#FF9800;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="2"><mxGeometry x="1944" y="216" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="15" value="C9 · Residual False-positive Audit&#xa;I → retain; C → remove pairing&#xa;About 0.9% of pairs removed overall&#xa;Repeat until below metric noise floor" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E3F2FD;strokeColor=#2196F3;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="2"><mxGeometry x="2200" y="88" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="16" value="Remove Pairing&#xa;Stage 2 side scorer = C&#xa;Task inventory remains unchanged" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ECEFF1;strokeColor=#607D8B;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="2"><mxGeometry x="2200" y="344" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="17" value="C10 · Paper v2 Task Inventory&#xa;Full: 20 / 1,667 main / 185 side&#xa;Public: 10 / 906 / 92&#xa;Withheld: 10 / 761 / 93&#xa;Scorers hidden only at agent run time" style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=15;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E8F5E9;strokeColor=#4CAF50;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="2"><mxGeometry x="2456" y="88" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="18" value="Public-artifact Drift · Audited 2026-07&#xa;Current repo: 10 / 907 / 92&#xa;Official site: 10 / 919 / 93&#xa;Paper cap 160; current CT default 150&#xa;No public leaderboard/submission path" style="shape=document;boundedLbl=1;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#9E9E9E;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#2